149 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (We had success with all three APIs when it came to gaining access and retrieving reliable data. Each API had enough information to pull at least 100 records, which allowed us to build out our individual database tables. Originally, we had separate databases for each API, but as the project progressed, we realized it made more sense to centralize everything into one database with separate tables to make analysis and joins more efficient.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
