151 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (We used this API to collect individual player scores for multiple tournaments. Specifically, we gathered player names, their unique IDs, the tournament ID, and total score for each tournament round. We then wrote these into a table within our unified database and used the data to identify top 10 finishes and wins by comparing scores across tournaments.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
