153 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (From Sport Radar, we pulled global ranking data for each player, including first and last name, a locally generated ID, events played, and total ranking points. We stored this in a table and used it to compute average points per event for each player. This became part of our prediction model for projecting player performance over the rest of the season.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [7]
>>
